### Hot lead — clear scope, budget, real company
POST http://localhost:5678/webhook/lead
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anna Larsen",
  "email": "anna@larsen-logistics.dk",
  "company": "Larsen Logistics",
  "website": "https://larsen-logistics.dk",
  "budget": "$5k – $20k",
  "message": "We need an iOS and Android app for our drivers to scan deliveries and sync with our REST API. Launch target is March."
}

### Cold lead — vague, no budget
POST http://localhost:5678/webhook/lead
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mike",
  "email": "mike123@gmail.com",
  "company": "",
  "website": "",
  "budget": "Under $1k",
  "message": "app like uber cheap"
}
